file mantra/src/weave.rye Note, Reading, annotate and its two folds, recovered from the stash; the head lists five operations and its build line matches the binary the guard builds
file mantra/src/weave_annotate_witness.rye ten claims proven by doing, the fourth holding annotate to merge count for count
file tools/fixtures/m/mantra_weave_head_scan.sh the head held to the module's own pub fn declarations, both directions at zero
file tools/fixtures/m/mantra_weave_annotate_control.sh thirteen phases, three innocence legs and ten breaks
file tools/m/mantra_weave_annotate_witness.rish the runner; it says the scan's lines before it asserts on them
